Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:10.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介悶在寢室裡好幾天了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生了什麼 我不得而知
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:22.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你等我 恭介
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會重建Little Busters的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我把大家都帶去見他 恭介一定會開懷大笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:43.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…和兒時一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個要拉入伙的是謙吾對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:38.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他這關就難了 看不出來他有半點加入的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.96,0:02:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎麼做?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.57,0:02:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介是怎麼把謙吾拉入伙的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還記得小時候的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.53,0:02:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介當時去踢館了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.03,0:02:50.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,踢館?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某天我們得知了這樣一個傳聞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:03:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本鎮有個小學生在一個叫全日本少年什麼的劍道大賽中奪了冠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.34,0:03:03.61,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,我鎮的少年劍士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個小學生就是謙吾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:06.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一躍成為了我們鎮的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後因為他家是個道場 恭介就想到要去踢館
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:16.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大叫一聲「求指教!」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和謙吾他爹打了一場
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和他爸爸打?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之他爹是道場老師 強得很
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介打敗了他爹後 謙吾就入伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶 謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還記得小時候恭介去你家踢館時的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:04:02.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介為什麼不是和你 而是和你爸爸交手了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.55,0:04:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 我先聲明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.30,0:04:10.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會加入Little Busters的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要再向前了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:22.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾他…看穿了我的意圖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介? 我進來咯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.25,0:04:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒在睡覺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出什麼事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:56.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想把心裡的苦楚吐露出來…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:05:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 恭介現在正因某事受到傷害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…必須變堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想來看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃飯 別搞垮了身體哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我走了 再見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾他…撒了一個謊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.50,0:05:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你剛剛說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.55,0:05:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 恭介這麼說的?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:43.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他透露給我 說謙吾撒謊了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如他其實是雙胞胎之一 兩人經常交換身份?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實他60歲了 牙全是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:06.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾 你剛剛試圖用右手翻頁了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們盯著 你就換左手重新翻了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,試圖用右手 然後又縮了回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.01,0:06:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傷已經好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抑或是…你根本沒受傷?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:26.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要撒這種謊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這傷你連新人戰都放棄了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你其實不想出賽?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:39.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我回答你 你會停止繼續招集Little Busters嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來你的確知道我不瞭解的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生了什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:49.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們為什麼會變成一盤散沙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你繼續走下去 會抵達哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:59.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等待著你的 只有黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.70,0:07:01.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什麼都不用知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無憂無慮地玩下去就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我辦不到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家臉上沒了笑容 恭介都面目全非了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:14.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哪還能做得到無憂無慮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想讓大家重新露出笑臉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像恭介以前為我做的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.78,0:07:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能和你們絕交
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:48.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該怎麼做…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超越我 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變強吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不知道時間地點 但我確實發過誓了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發誓成為不輸恭介的領隊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:19.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 你要怎麼做 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會放棄Little Busters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那謙吾就要絕交了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個我也不答應
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這兩點能同時做到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.69,0:08:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會做到的…無論用什麼手段
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用實力幹翻他 謙吾就會入夥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾有這麼單純嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:44.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定他才是最單純的那個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟本質上是個白癡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 我贏得了謙吾嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他從小就沒跟人比輸過
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我連劍道用的竹劍都沒握過
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 用棒球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.53,0:09:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用棒球對決!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我投接球都是最近才開始玩的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或許有得一拼哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果不試試怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:25.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:27.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 既然這麼定了就加緊訓練吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:29.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾 我找你半天了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會放棄的 來用棒球對決吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,動真格的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我贏了 你就加入Little Busters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:06.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不會拒絕的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:09.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天放學後 我在操場等你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 你還不知道這個世界的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同樣的事不知重複了多少遍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你全都忘掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來打棒球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹用棒球向我挑戰了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可憐…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他連那天的對決也忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:11:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隊友投球 先打出三個場外球的一方勝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我為了保護鈴和理樹和你對決了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我投咯 謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能行!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古式!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.16,0:11:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為何你此時此刻 會出現在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直兒戲!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:45.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介--!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.71,0:11:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比賽有效
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:58.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用了禁招
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:12:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你利用理樹還未發現的這世界的構造
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.93,0:12:03.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騙過了我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為保證計劃繼續進行 你不惜使用卑鄙手段
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你卻失敗了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.13,0:12:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一把將理樹和鈴推入了深淵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之所以變得這麼窩囊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為你的計劃弄巧成拙 你在自責
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是自作自受
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹和鈴還很軟弱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們還沒成熟到足以面對一切
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.37,0:12:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們必須保護好他們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:41.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們不會永遠長不大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人都會成長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這種閉鎖的世界中也會嗎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會贏的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.72,0:12:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後我要告訴理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「你只要在我們的保護之下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:13:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無憂無慮地玩下去就好」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:17.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我們比完 由我來全力保護你和鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到我不得不離開這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:39.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一對一 互相揮擊彼此扔出的球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:42.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先打出本壘打的人獲勝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正還是反
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜對了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就選後攻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:13:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我負責當裁判和捕手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:14:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,壞球可以無視
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過漏打三次好球就算三振出局
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有現在這一刻你會覺得我可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我們比完 我就永遠是站在你那邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.63,0:14:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好感受一下我有多可靠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開球
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:19.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通過…這一球!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 不揮棒是擊不中的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這場比試真無趣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:33.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我贏定了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我扔了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:47.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在認輸我不會有意見
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,揮空了 三振!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擦到了一點
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.27,0:15:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算界外球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹得好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.31,0:15:09.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不能就這麼輸掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不論如何都已經二好球了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.83,0:15:14.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一球…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能分勝負!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.90,0:15:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,界外球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是界外球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.86,0:15:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:40.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:43.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼還不放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:15:58.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為何要窮追不捨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你犯不著面對一切
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只要…躲在我的身後就好!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.98,0:16:12.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要拉謙吾入伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:14.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓大家團結一心!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我才是Little Busters的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,領隊啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶好耶好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這代表讓一切重置是不可能的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.17,0:16:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒完
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也打出本壘打就是平手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還行吧 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.64,0:17:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來你已經精疲力竭了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.24,0:17:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我還…能行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫停
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投手換人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投手換人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:28.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在危機關頭現身
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可是我和理樹的真格對決
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.63,0:17:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是認真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹已經全力應戰了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我也會全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾 我想和鈴一起努力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:54.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今也依然在某種層面上…連在一起嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就讓你們倆一起明白
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.57,0:18:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.73,0:18:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.61,0:18:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 你來當捕手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.38,0:18:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比賽繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.44,0:18:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我扔了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒入門的暴投
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.91,0:18:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別在意 鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肩膀要放鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肩膀要…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣…嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,界外球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.06,0:19:06.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來沒必要管壞球的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.57,0:19:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是壞球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但這次離擊球域相當近了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.18,0:19:16.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投的越來越好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像理樹那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,界外球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次是好球哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.93,0:19:36.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好球…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還是偏高的絕好球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.12,0:19:41.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼沒能打出本壘打
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.63,0:19:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經兩個好球了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.92,0:19:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩一球了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩一球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.57,0:19:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被逼到絕路了?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我居然…開始焦躁了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被他們倆的氣勢震住了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我活到現在 一直在為取勝而努力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.45,0:20:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為取勝才鍛煉出強韌的身心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是這種比試勝利依然是我的!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜歡從這裡仰望天空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:20.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我曾見過的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.41,0:20:22.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴君 就算你的球被擊中 我們也會在你身後幫你補回來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.52,0:20:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快投吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.86,0:20:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我們 相信你的夥伴!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.97,0:20:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別退縮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴 放手去做現在能做的事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.25,0:20:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正中央
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:54.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿下了!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:21:00.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然在這個節骨眼上扔出上旋喵速球了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好球 擊球手出局
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比賽結束
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我居然…輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我至今未嘗一敗…這次也應該取勝的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.37,0:21:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為取勝而努力至今的我的人生…到底算什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣 我打敗你老爹了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.07,0:21:40.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒人會用勝負套牢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.83,0:21:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你應該也想過當個傻瓜 無憂無慮地玩耍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直一語中的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是棗恭介
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從今天起我們就是朋友了 謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.17,0:21:54.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.94,0:21:59.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 帶我走吧 恭介
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼哭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…悔恨之淚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.29,0:22:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.26,0:22:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想…再多玩一會兒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你們一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.17,0:22:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們再玩會兒吧 棒球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.14,0:22:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來…就和勝負…無關了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起玩吧 謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像傻瓜一樣 無憂無慮地 一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.51,0:22:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.40,0:23:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再讓我…哭會兒嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(691,280)\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&\fsp15}第9話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\an6\pos(778,310)\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&\fsp15}摯友之淚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.93,0:23:35.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界的終焉即將到來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 我又要重來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:11.47,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ひとりじゃ寂しい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:17.78,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}だから手を繋いだんだっけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:28.76,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}それじゃいつまでも 子供のままだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:36.49,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}どうしても伝えたかったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.05,0:01:42.56,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}繋いだ手はもう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:49.14,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ばらばらになる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:52.93,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ひとつずつ消えてゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:59.61,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}目覚める日へ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:09.24,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}とっとと走っていけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:23.98,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}祭りのあとのようで 寂しいだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:11.47,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}一個人太孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:17.78,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}才會牽起彼此的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:28.76,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}但這樣只會讓人無法成長
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:36.49,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}無論如何我都要告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.05,0:01:42.56,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}牽起的手就要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:49.14,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}四散分離
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:52.93,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}逐一消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:59.61,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}向著夢醒之日
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:09.24,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}大步向前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:23.98,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}恰如曲終人散時 空剩寂寥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:46.30,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}忘れたままでも生きてゆける　それでも
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.69,0:19:59.56,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}思い出せば振り返れば癒えることない傷がある
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:11.62,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}そのままでそのままでいい　流れ落ちる雫も
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:23.86,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}目を反らさずに見つめて生きてゆけるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:31.97,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}誰のために僕らはゆく？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.97,0:20:38.91,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}誰のためにまた目覚める？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:52.54,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}誰がいても誰もいなくても声を贈るよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.73,0:21:19.27,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}心を閉ざしてしまうならそれもいい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:31.77,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}ただひとつとっておきの贈り物を持ってるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.11,0:21:37.92,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}いつかまた気づくはずだ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.08,0:21:44.12,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}そんな朝は眩しく
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.69,0:21:56.52,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}つま先だって大人になったきみがいる
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:22:04.38,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}誰のために僕らはゆく？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:11.67,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}誰のためにまた目覚める？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.67,0:22:25.45,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(200,200)\be9}誰がいても誰もいなくてももいなくても　ずっと待ってるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:40.59,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(200,200)\be9}LaLaLa…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.59,0:22:55.14,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be9}誰がいても誰もいなくなっても仆僕は唄うよ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:46.30,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}哪怕忘了這一切  也能生活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.69,0:19:59.56,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不過每當再次回想起來  總會留下銘心的痛楚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:11.62,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只好流著淚不斷安慰自己「這樣就好」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:23.86,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}若能有一個不留遺憾的結局的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:31.97,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}為了誰我們不斷前行？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.97,0:20:38.91,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}為了誰我們再次醒來？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:52.54,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不管有沒有人  依然給予鼓勵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.73,0:21:19.27,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}把心封閉起來也沒有關係
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:31.77,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只要擁有那最珍貴的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.11,0:21:37.92,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}總有一天會察覺到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.08,0:21:44.12,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}朝陽是如此的耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.69,0:21:56.52,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}站在身旁的是已成長起來的你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:22:04.38,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}為了誰我們不斷前行？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:11.67,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}為了誰我們再次醒來？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.67,0:22:25.45,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不管還有沒有人 依然在等待著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:40.59,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}LaLaLa…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.59,0:22:55.14,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不管有沒有人  我們依然高歌
